async function compareMenuStyles(){await choose('Three workflow menu styles',`<div class="style-comparison"><article><h3>1. Guided cards</h3><span class="pill">CURRENT DRAFT · RECOMMENDED</span><div class="style-mini"><div class="mini-find">FIND · Quiet sections</div><div class="mini-if">IF · A section matches<div class="mini-do">THEN · Keep up to 20 seconds</div><div class="mini-do">AND · Play at 1.3×</div></div></div><p>Ordered cards with explicit Then / Otherwise branches. Easy to scan, rearrange, and grow.</p></article><article><h3>2. Sentence recipe</h3><div class="style-mini recipe-mini">When audio is <em>quieter than −40 dBFS</em> for <em>at least 2 seconds</em>, keep <em>up to 20 seconds</em> and play it at <em>1.3×</em>. Otherwise, <em>keep it unchanged</em>.</div><p>Reads like a short instruction with inline controls. Best for simple workflows; nested logic becomes wordy.</p></article><article><h3>3. Branching flowchart</h3><div class="style-mini flow-mini"><div>Find quiet sections</div><span>↓</span><div>Does this section match?</div><span>↙ YES　　NO ↘</span><div class="mini-do">Shorten → Speed up</div><div>Keep unchanged</div></div><p>Shows routes and dependencies clearly. Best for larger branching workflows; needs more space and navigation.</p></article></div>`,[{id:'close',label:'Close comparison',kind:'primary'}],true);}
